<NAME>Broward RFP deadline</NAME>
<CONTENT>For the Broward Education Foundation, Inc. Request for Proposal to provide investment manager services, proposers must submit six (6) copies of the proposal. The deadline is no later than 5:00 PM on July 1, 2016.

Relevant supporting details from the RFP:
- Section III, “Brevity of Proposals,” says the proposal should be no longer than 5 single-spaced typewritten pages, not including backup documents.
- Section V, “Submission of Proposals,” states: “Six (6) copies of your proposal must be submitted … no later than 5 PM on July 1, 2016.”

So the answer is: six copies, due by 5:00 PM on July 1, 2016.</CONTENT>
